sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Client
    participant P as Page Paiement
    participant S as Serveur Laravel
    participant GW as Passerelle Paiement
    participant BD as Base de Donnees
    C->>P: Choisir methode de paiement
    alt Stripe Carte Bancaire
        P->>S: POST /client/payments/stripe
        S->>GW: Creer session Stripe Checkout
        GW-->>S: URL de paiement
        S-->>P: Redirection vers Stripe
        C->>GW: Saisir informations carte
        GW->>S: POST /stripe/webhook
        S->>BD: UPDATE payment (status=paid)
    else Orange Money
        P->>S: POST /client/payments/orange-money
        S->>GW: Initier paiement Orange Money
        GW-->>S: URL de paiement
        S-->>P: Redirection vers Orange Money
        C->>GW: Confirmer avec code OTP
        GW->>S: POST /orange-money/callback
        S->>BD: UPDATE payment (status=paid)
    else Wave
        P->>S: POST /client/payments/wave
        S->>GW: Initier paiement Wave
        GW-->>S: URL de paiement
        S-->>P: Redirection vers Wave
        C->>GW: Confirmer paiement
        GW->>S: POST /wave/callback
        S->>BD: UPDATE payment (status=paid)
    else Especes au salon
        P->>S: POST /client/payments/cash
        S->>BD: INSERT payment (status=pending)
    end
    S->>BD: INSERT notification client
    S-->>P: Confirmation paiement
    P-->>C: Afficher recu
